// The **Audio** screen's player, and it is one node.
//
// `audio-player` is `goldberry-media`'s widget, and this document never says
// where it comes from: the module is on the module path, its catalog declares
// the node name, and the inflater finds it, exactly as `markdown-view`
// is found on the Markdown screen.
//
// `player=` names a MediaPlayer the model registered as a **named object**.
// It is neither a value nor an action: a player is an object with a
// life of its own, which the screen's cards drive from Java at the same time.
audio-player id="audio-player" player="audio.player"
